e end of each applicable interest period. Upon the occurrence of an event of default, all outstanding amounts bear interest at the applicable rate <i style="font-style:italic;">plus</i> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_x-DraIrURkqybk-ATSvGbg" contextRef="Duration_7_29_2025_To_7_29_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xbp_SuperSeniorTermLoanMaturingJuly282028Member_QlEffTXbWUyCy0BJuVDaWw" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xbp:DebtDefaultIncrementalInterestRateOverApplicableRate" scale="-2" id="Narr_mjhWC8aOtEiLpRNAvq1t8Q">2.0</ix:nonFraction>% per annum, payable on demand.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;">As of December 31, 2025, there were borrowings of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_q4HVJlM7Q0StRndL3BeWvQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xbp_SuperSeniorTermLoanMaturingJuly282028Member_4DS-jEHgvUu7fvPsZKgLDw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" scale="6" id="Narr_rAVb3wnBsEGjsCl8gAkdsA">46.0</ix:nonFraction> million outstanding under the Super Senior Term Loan. The Super Senior Term Loan is scheduled to mature on July 28, 2028. Voluntary prepayments are permitted at any time with <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_D_xSp-xN0rrk-N60eCZSnFTQ" contextRef="Duration_7_29_2025_To_7_29_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xbp_SuperSeniorTermLoanMaturingJuly282028Member_QlEffTXbWUyCy0BJuVDaWw" decimals="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="xbp:DebtInstrumentPrepaymentThresholdNumberOfBusinessDaysOfNotice" scale="0" id="Narr_Aeq6G2chfkyYGNEHOi9c0w">five</ix:nonFraction> business days&#8217; notice, provided accrued interest is paid and, if applicable, a prepayment premium is </p></ix:continuation></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">112</p></div></div>
