ditor Agreement (as described below) and that certain Super Senior Intercreditor Agreement. The Super Senior Term Loan contains customary affirmative and negative covenants, including limitations on additional indebtedness, the granting of liens, asset sales, restricted payments, affiliate transactions, and changes in business. It also includes a financial covenant requiring the Issuer to maintain the ratio of (a) Indebtedness to (b) Covenant Consolidated EBITDA of no greater than <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_x-DraIrURkqybk-ATSvGbg" contextRef="As_Of_7_29_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xbp_SuperSeniorTermLoanMaturingJuly282028Member_bETgeyaF2EyKnjTHq34RWA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xbp:DebtInstrumentCovenantIndebtednessToConsolidatedEbitda" scale="0" id="Narr_Ejv-lf8orkO6-cjgqyldZA">1.00</ix:nonFraction> to 1.00 based on the trailing 12 months ended as of the last day of the most recently ended fiscal quarter. The Super Senior Term Loan Borrowers are also required to maintain liquidity of at least $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_q4HVJlM7Q0StRndL3BeWvQ" contextRef="As_Of_7_29_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xbp_SuperSeniorTermLoanMaturingJuly282028Member_bETgeyaF2EyKnjTHq34RWA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xbp:DebtInstrumentCovenantMinimumLiquidityRequirement" scale="6" id="Narr_VNDC9IIklEWTu8b9XdwCgw">2.0</ix:nonFraction> million (or $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_q4HVJlM7Q0StRndL3BeWvQ" contextRef="As_Of_7_29_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xbp_SuperSeniorTermLoanMaturingJuly282028Member_bETgeyaF2EyKnjTHq34RWA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xbp:DebtInstrumentCovenantMinimumLiquidityRequirementUponOccurrenceOfIncrementalFacility" scale="6" id="Narr_GVeuirNh2E6O8MDe46kdBA">10.0</ix:nonFraction> million after the incurrence of any Incremental Facility). The Super Senior Term Loan Borrowers were in compliance with all financial covenants as of December 31, 2025.</p><p 