t 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On July 29, 2025, Exela Technologies BPA, LLC and certain of its subsidiaries (collectively, the &#8220;ABL Borrowers&#8221;) entered into a $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_q4HVJlM7Q0StRndL3BeWvQ" contextRef="As_Of_7_29_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xbp_AblFacilityMaturingJuly292028Member_RPqZSbQo4k2g0uJ4w5XThw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityMaximumBorrowingCapacity" scale="6" id="Narr_MrDTXVdzKkOiZGi5EsyEDA">150.0</ix:nonFraction> million Asset-Based Lending Credit and Security Agreement (as amended, the &#8220;ABL Facility&#8221;) with MidCap Funding IV Trust, as administrative and collateral agent (the &#8220;Agent&#8221;), and a syndicate of lenders (the &#8220;ABL Lenders&#8221;). The ABL Facility was executed in connection with BPA&#8217;s emergence from the Chapter 11 Cases and provides for revolving commitments of up to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_q4HVJlM7Q0StRndL3BeWvQ" contextRef="As_Of_7_29_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xbp_AblFacilityMaturingJuly292028Member_RPqZSbQo4k2g0uJ4w5XThw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityMaximumBorrowingCapacity" scale="6" id="Narr_Gjhb6e0FoEmAUJ7NUwjVWg">150.0</ix:nonFraction> million, with an option to increase to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_q4HVJlM7Q0StRndL3BeWvQ" contextRef="As_Of_7_29_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xbp_AblFacilityMaturingJuly292028Member_RPqZSbQo4k2g0uJ4w5XThw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xbp:LineOfCreditAdditionalBorrowingCapacity" scale="6" id="Narr_se-guEaXOE2WC2-YGGoJWQ">175.0</ix:nonFraction> million through an additional tranche. The borrowing availability under the ABL Facility is limited to the lesser of (i) the aggregate revolving commitments and (ii) the borrowing base, which is calculated by reference to eligible billed and unbilled receivables, certain other receivables, eligible cash, and related assets, reduced by reserves established by the Agent. Borrowings under the ABL Facility bear an interest at Term <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Hidden_XlIXC-amRE6LCnYWYsNBog;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">SOFR</span></span> plus an applicable margin ranging from <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_x-DraIrURkqybk-ATSvGbg" contextRef="Duration_7_29_2025_To_7_29_2025_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MinimumMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xbp_AblFacilityMaturingJuly292028Member_vLhX2k9aB0mGQ5gHTcVwSw" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentBasisSpreadOnVariableRate1" scale="-2" id="Narr_LnYARaCycUm30U20hDR6LA">3.8</ix:nonFraction>% to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_x-DraIrURkqybk-ATSvGbg" contextRef="Duration_7_29_2025_To_7_29_2025_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MaximumMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xbp_AblFacilityMaturingJuly292028Member_QTYIUWoAgkKkkkxCv4iaUw" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentBasisSpreadOnVariableRate1" scale="-2" id="Narr_5_bcPFziz0yqdjHngOq6Fg">4.3</ix:nonFraction>%, depending on the ABL Borrowers&#8217; trailing twelve-month EBITDA, subject to a <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_x-DraIrURkqybk-ATSvGbg" contextRef="As_Of_7_29_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xbp_AblFacilityMaturingJuly292028Member_RPqZSbQo4k2g0uJ4w5XThw" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xbp:DebtInstrumentFloorRate" scale="-2" id="Narr_F7G4zEx1yUqGp4gHPuuxjg">1.0</ix:nonFraction>% SOFR floor. Interest is payable monthly, with a <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_x-DraIrURkqybk-ATSvGbg" contextRef="Duration_7_29_2025_To_7_29_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xbp_AblFacilityMaturingJuly292028Member_ovEwgG-vzkiilyVDrV15mQ" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xbp:DebtInstrumentDefaultPremiumPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_Gzq891ur70uySBjMwBQixg">2.0</ix:nonFraction>% default premium. In addition to interest, the ABL Borrowers are required to pay an unused commitment fee of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_x-DraIrURkqybk-ATSvGbg" contextRef="Duration_7_29_2025_To_7_29_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xbp_AblFacilityMaturingJuly292028Member_ovEwgG-vzkiilyVDrV15mQ" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityUnusedCapacityCommitmentFeePercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_6_dR4iSwiU-MWLFWdzmivA">0.5</ix:nonFraction>% per annum on the average daily unused portion of the commitments, customary letter of credit fees on the face amount of each outstanding letter of credit, a collateral management fee payable to the Agent, and a minimum balance fee if borrowings under the ABL Facility fall below <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_x-DraIrURkqybk-ATSvGbg" contextRef="Duration_7_29_2025_To_7_29_2025_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MinimumMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xbp_AblFacilityMaturingJuly292028Member_vLhX2k9aB0mGQ5gHTcVwSw" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xbp:LineOfCreditFacilityThresholdBorrowingsBaseTriggerPercentageForPaymentOfMinimumBalanceFee" scale="-2" id="Narr_4zWxZJlb8kiinsfyUV-pzg">20.0</ix:nonFraction>% of the Borrowing Base. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">As of December 31, 2025 (Successor), there were borrowings of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_q4HVJlM7Q0StRndL3BeWvQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xbp_AblFacilityMaturingJuly292028Member_eNlgTibL5EawjrOvCSN3ug" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentCarryingAmount" scale="6" id="Narr_SZPka8eURU6oS7yyRgtkng">76.8</ix:nonFraction> million outstanding under the ABL Facility. There were unamortized debt issuance costs of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_q4HVJlM7Q0StRndL3BeWvQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xbp_AblFacilityMaturingJuly292028Member_eNlgTibL5EawjrOvCSN3ug" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DeferredFinanceCostsNoncurrentNet" scale="6" id="Narr_v9yUB5WuvkK6ozP7fcP54A">1.9</ix:nonFraction> million on the ABL Facility as of December 31, 2025 included in other noncurrent assets on the consolidated balance sheet. The ABL Facility matures on July 29, 2028, and may be prepaid at any time without penalty (other than breakage costs). Mandatory repayments are required from proceeds of dispositions of the ABL Priority Collateral, certain insurance proceeds, or upon acceleration following an event of default. The events of default include failure to pay principal, interest or fees when due; breaches of covenants or other material contractual obligations; materially inaccurate representations or warranties; failure to pay specified other indebtedness above $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_q4HVJlM7Q0StRndL3BeWvQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xbp_AblFacilityMaturingJuly292028Member_eNlgTibL5EawjrOvCSN3ug" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xbp:DebtInstrumentDebtDefaultMinimumThresholdAmount" scale="6" id="Narr_dintT0TXeUyICaR_B1kv-g">25.0</ix:nonFraction> million; bankruptcy or insolvency; final unsatisfied judgments; ERISA-related defaults; and a change in control.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The obligations under the ABL Facility are guaranteed on a joint and several basis by substantially all of the ABL Borrowers&#8217; U.S. subsidiaries. The liens securing the ABL Facility are subject to an Intercreditor Agreement (the &#8220;ABL Intercreditor Agreement&#8221;) dated July 29, 2025, among MidCap Funding IV Trust, Ankura Trust Company, LLC, as Term Agent, BRF Finance Co., LLC, as Riley Agent, and U.S. Bank Trust Company, National Association, as July 2030 Notes Trustee. The ABL Intercreditor Agreement governs lien priorities including (i) relative priorities for the collateral securing the ABL Facility obligations, the Super Senior Term Loan obligations, the July 2030 Notes Indenture obligations and the Second Lien Note obligations; (ii) collateral priorities securing (a) any Second Lien Note obligations, (b) any Super Senior Term Loan obligations, (c) any July 2030 Notes Indenture obligations, or (d) any Excess ABL Debt; and (iii) prohibition on contesting liens. The ABL Facility is secured by a first-priority lien on certain ABL Priority Collateral (including receivables, cash, inventory, deposit accounts, and related assets) and a junior lien on certain Term Priority Collateral (as defined therein), subject to the ABL Intercreditor Agreement.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;">The ABL Facility includes customary affirmative covenants such as reporting, collateral maintenance, insurance, and inspections, and negative covenants, including restrictions on additional indebtedness, liens, asset sales, investments, affiliate transactions, and changes in business, with a minimum fixed charge coverage ratio, tested if excess availability falls below a defined threshold. The ABL Facility requires the ABL Borrowers to maintain a minimum fixed charge coverage ratio, calculated on a trailing twelve-month basis. The fixed charge coverage ratio is defined as the ratio </p></ix:continuation></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">114</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:79.3%;border:0;margin:30pt 10.35% 30pt 10.35%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:10.35%;padding-right:10.35%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:21.6pt;min-height:41.75pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 30pt 0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><ix:continuation id="Tb_udzskiT0oEKoAbGWYZJxLA_cont4" continuedAt="Tb_udzskiT0oEKoAbGWYZJxLA_cont5"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">of EBITDA <i style="font-style:italic;">less</i> Unfinanced Capital Expenditures <i style="font-style:italic;">less </i>Capitalized Software Expenditures, to Fixed Charges (as such terms are defined in the ABL Facility). The minimum required ratio varies depending on the period: for the defined periods tested quarterly through December 31, 2025, and monthly from January 1, 2026 through June 30, 2026, the fixed charge coverage ratio must be not less than <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_x-DraIrURkqybk-ATSvGbg" contextRef="As_Of_7_29_2025_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_xbp_DefinedPeriodTestedQuarterlyThroughDecember312025AndMonthlyFromJanuary12026ThroughJune302026Member_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xbp_AblFacilityMaturingJuly292028Member_seu-hzTVOk-BujnNcZyAcw" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xbp:DebtInstrumentCovenantMinimumFixedChargeCoverageRatio" scale="0" id="Narr_A1Gl-SoN8U-weUno_8ZKPQ">0.85</ix:nonFraction> to 1.00. Thereafter, for the defined periods tested monthly from July 1, 2026, through the maturity date, the fixed charge coverage ratio must be not less than <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_x-DraIrURkqybk-ATSvGbg" contextRef="As_Of_7_29_2025_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_xbp_DefinedPeriodsTestedMonthlyFromJuly12026ThroughMaturityDateMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xbp_AblFacilityMaturingJuly292028Member_f6rfiISG90GjaiD4caO02Q" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xbp:DebtInstrumentCovenantMinimumFixedChargeCoverageRatio" scale="0" id="Narr_K1KjAphz2kae_XC-lzDvGw">1.00</ix:nonFraction> to 1.00. The ABL Facility also requires maintaining minimum excess availability of not less than $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_q4HVJlM7Q0StRndL3BeWvQ" contextRef="As_Of_7_29_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xbp_AblFacilityMaturingJuly292028Member_RPqZSbQo4k2g0uJ4w5XThw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xbp:DebtInstrumentCovenantMinimumLiquidityRequirement" scale="6" id="Narr_9eKF_z8d6UGSeafkA7LTwA">7.5</ix:nonFraction> million at any time for <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_D_xSp-xN0rrk-N60eCZSnFTQ" contextRef="Duration_7_29_2025_To_7_29_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xbp_AblFacilityMaturingJuly292028Member_ovEwgG-vzkiilyVDrV15mQ" decimals="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="xbp:DebtInstrumentCovenantMinimumLiquidityRequirementThresholdNumberOfConsecutiveBusinessDays" scale="0" id="Narr_dvUjUoG3o0KrXk3cQPYoxQ">three</ix:nonFraction> (3) or more consecutive business days through June 30, 2026. The Company was in compliance with all financial covenants as of December 31, 2025 (Successor).</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Senior Credit Facilities Agreement</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">In June 2024, XBP Europe, Inc., a wholly owned subsidiary of the Company, together with certain other subsidiaries, entered into a Facilities Agreement (the &#8220;Facilities Agreement&#8221;) with HSBC UK Bank plc (&#8220;HSBC&#8221;) for a &#163;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_GBP_Yd64EMz_3E6VToakbinI-w" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xbp_FacilitiesAgreement2024Member_DLG5HV0ZnE21QAF3_oMlgg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityMaximumBorrowingCapacity" scale="6" id="Narr_BLV072qm80m7fM86Z2faPA">15.0</ix:nonFraction> million and &#8364;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_EUR_2AHvSTibH0SJbPIxyIC27w" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xbp_FacilitiesAgreement2024Member_DLG5HV0ZnE21QAF3_oMlgg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityMaximumBorrowingCapacity" scale="6" id="Narr_YGjlRD5kBEiFYwu_q9kDsA">10.5</ix:nonFraction> million secured credit facility consisting of (i) a single draw, secured Term Loan A facility in an aggregate principal amount of &#163;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_GBP_Yd64EMz_3E6VToakbinI-w" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xbp_TermLoan2028FacilityMember_o-K_wSbY0kmQHfQNt5wi9w" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityMaximumBorrowingCapacity" scale="6" id="Narr_0sRMtqEItEeCRQUqbukIWw">3.0</ix:nonFraction> million (the &#8220;2028 Term Loan A Facility&#8221;), (ii) a single draw, secured Term Loan B facility in an aggregate principal amount of &#8364;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_EUR_2AHvSTibH0SJbPIxyIC27w" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xbp_TermLoan2028BFacilityMember_S8RO8_qzPUWJP8rw4Gdqlw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityMaximumBorrowingCapacity" scale="6" id="Narr_sn8U0HcbN0qZDQw3pm55CA">10.5</ix:nonFraction> million (the &#8220;2028 Term Loan B Facility&#8221;, collectively with the 2028 Term Loan A Facility, the &#8220;2028 Term Loan Facilities&#8221;) and (iii) a multi-draw, multi-currency secured revolving credit facility in an aggregate principal amount of &#163;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_GBP_Yd64EMz_3E6VToakbinI-w" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_us-gaap_RevolvingCreditFacilityMember_9Zu8lxPx_0u8sGAeiUpV2A" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityMaximumBorrowingCapacity" scale="6" id="Narr_7U0_zbQgekKAZpgJdsPgrQ">12.0</ix:nonFraction> million (the &#8220;Revolving Credit Facility&#8221;), and, together with the 2028 Term Loan Facilities, (the &#8220;Senior Credit Facilities&#8221;). Pursuant to the original Facilities Agreement, the 2028 Term Loan Facilities mature on June 26, 2028, and the Revolving Credit Facility matures on June 26, 2027, with certain extension rights at the discretion of HSBC. Borrowings under the 2028 Term Loan A Facility, the 2028 Term Loan B Facility and Revolving Credit Facility bear interest at a rate per annum equal to the SONIA plus the applicable margin of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_x-DraIrURkqybk-ATSvGbg" contextRef="Duration_6_1_2024_To_6_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xbp_TermLoan2028FacilityMember_us-gaap_VariableRateAxis_xbp_SterlingOvernightIndexAverageMember_Mj47X-2SBUGbYumHcMoLbA" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentBasisSpreadOnVariableRate1" scale="-2" id="Narr_R_QknvxiNk-iBX91Ucx7bA">3.25</ix:nonFraction>%, Euro Interbank Offered Rate (&#8220;EURIBOR&#8221;) plus the applicable margin of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_x-DraIrURkqybk-ATSvGbg" contextRef="Duration_6_1_2024_To_6_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xbp_TermLoan2028BFacilityMember_us-gaap_VariableRateAxis_xbp_EuroInterbankOfferedRateMember_ymNkDyhH6UKVuEIZpjeUuA" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentBasisSpreadOnVariableRate1" scale="-2" id="Narr_UbfNUG_6xkSfx0me2PJSkw">3.25</ix:nonFraction>% and Reference Rate plus the applicable margin of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_x-DraIrURkqybk-ATSvGbg" contextRef="Duration_6_1_2024_To_6_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_us-gaap_RevolvingCreditFacilityMember_us-gaap_VariableRateAxis_xbp_ReferenceRateMember_06piAWeSEE6rdaZ4iGQ-yQ" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentBasisSpreadOnVariableRate1" scale="-2" id="Narr_1zXun5e9mE6LkSidvmCNxA">3.25</ix:nonFraction>%, respectively. &#8220;Reference Rate&#8221; for any period means (i) Secured Overnight Financing Rate (&#8220;SOFR&#8221;) for funds extended in U.S. Dollars; (ii) the EURIBOR, for funds extended in Euros; (iii) the SONIA, for funds extended in Pounds Sterling; and the Stockholm Interbank Offered Rate (&#8220;STIBOR&#8221;) for funds extended in Swedish Krona.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On July 25, 2025, an amendment to the Facilities Agreement was executed to permit the borrowing of an additional sum of &#8364;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_EUR_2AHvSTibH0SJbPIxyIC27w" contextRef="Duration_7_25_2025_To_7_25_2025_j4fB62h8gkep2es2fYkfuw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromLongTermLinesOfCredit" scale="6" id="Narr_2uV-qvyeM0m3jqUx50WNWA">16.1</ix:nonFraction> million, the equivalent of &#163;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_GBP_Yd64EMz_3E6VToakbinI-w" contextRef="Duration_7_25_2025_To_7_25_2025_j4fB62h8gkep2es2fYkfuw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromLongTermLinesOfCredit" scale="6" id="Narr_b1-oR_cxY0aJxgitARM7fg">14.0</ix:nonFraction> million, under the Revolving Credit Facility. The drawdowns were made in Euro and used for general corporate purposes. This amendment extended the maturity of the Revolving Credit Facility to June 26, 2028, and updated certain definitions and covenants reflecting the Company&#8217;s new corporate structure following the Business Combination as discussed in Note 5<i style="font-style:italic;">, Business Combination</i>.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The Senior Credit Facilities continue to be secured by first-ranking security interests over substantially all assets of XBP Europe, Inc. and other borrower and guarantor subsidiaries, including cash, receivables, inventory, intercompany receivables, shares in subsidiaries, and related assets. The amendment added a new covenant restricting XBP Global Holdings, Inc., as the parent of XBP Europe, Inc., from providing certain guarantees or other credit support. Except as otherwise provided by applicable law, all obligations under the Facilities Agreement are jointly and severally unconditionally guaranteed by the European subsidiaries of XBP Europe, Inc.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The outstanding principal amount of the 2028 Term Loan A Facility is scheduled to be repaid in <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_installment_VRfAf-BxOUKFxVZDCQvn7w" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xbp_TermLoan2028FacilityMember_o-K_wSbY0kmQHfQNt5wi9w" decimals="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="xbp:LineOfCreditFacilityPeriodicPaymentNumberOfInstallments" scale="0" id="Narr_6PReagHI_Ea6p0utsQ2RNw">fifteen</ix:nonFraction> (15) equal quarterly installments of &#163;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_GBP_Yd64EMz_3E6VToakbinI-w" contextRef="Duration_6_1_2024_To_6_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xbp_TermLoan2028FacilityMember_yAfLoLZHPEKbffWP5C3pUw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityPeriodicPayment" scale="3" id="Narr_qxN7xALkckuVjK4-54PR_A">150</ix:nonFraction> thousand, which commenced September 30, 2024, with the remaining outstanding principal amount of &#163;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_GBP_Yd64EMz_3E6VToakbinI-w" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xbp_TermLoan2028FacilityMember_o-K_wSbY0kmQHfQNt5wi9w" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentPeriodicPaymentTermsBalloonPaymentToBePaid" scale="3" id="Narr__g-DuZHKyEOiUwfXcQHRJg">750</ix:nonFraction> thousand payable at maturity along with accrued and unpaid interest. The outstanding principal amount of the 2028 Term Loan B Facility is scheduled to be repaid in <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_installment_VRfAf-BxOUKFxVZDCQvn7w" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xbp_TermLoan2028BFacilityMember_S8RO8_qzPUWJP8rw4Gdqlw" decimals="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="xbp:LineOfCreditFacilityPeriodicPaymentNumberOfInstallments" scale="0" id="Narr_rfL1IQUL0UC4s3-o9RSYyg">fifteen</ix:nonFraction> (15) equal quarterly installments of &#8364;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_EUR_2AHvSTibH0SJbPIxyIC27w" contextRef="Duration_6_1_2024_To_6_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xbp_TermLoan2028BFacilityMember_uzooq0VvvkKCL0oqtc_7Pg" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityPeriodicPayment" scale="3" id="Narr_brBam5WQk0eXy1Jx0gFyRw">525</ix:nonFraction> thousand, which commenced September 30, 2024, with the remaining outstanding principal amount of &#8364;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_EUR_2AHvSTibH0SJbPIxyIC27w" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xbp_TermLoan2028BFacilityMember_S8RO8_qzPUWJP8rw4Gdqlw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentPeriodicPaymentTermsBalloonPaymentToBePaid" scale="6" id="Narr_JrDw0rrxQkyYzsuUz34b0A">2.6</ix:nonFraction> million payable at maturity along with accrued and unpaid interest. The Company may, at any time, prepay the principal of the Senior Credit Facilities. Each prepayment shall be accompanied by the payment of accrued interest, without any premium or penalty. However, the Company is limited to a maximum of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_item_tdvsG5cXsUe6fpm61iod_A" contextRef="Duration_6_1_2024_To_6_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_us-gaap_RevolvingCreditFacilityMember__99azFEy50e_XUR107HYUw" decimals="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="xbp:LineOfCreditFacilityMaximumNumberOfVoluntaryPrepaymentsPerAnnum" scale="0" id="Narr_-KD2KT6UJkqOot4XIl5QYA">four</ix:nonFraction> voluntary prepayments of the Revolving Credit Facility within any consecutive twelve-month period. During the period August 1, 2025 to December 31, 2025, the Company repaid $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_q4HVJlM7Q0StRndL3BeWvQ" contextRef="Duration_8_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MaximumMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xbp_TermLoan2028FacilitiesMaturingJune262028Member_-nHCfAke8E69g-OmdIqxuA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:RepaymentsOfLongTermLinesOfCredit" scale="6" id="Narr_WLaSAG8SBkmAxcbANWL5mg">1.6</ix:nonFraction> million of outstanding principal amount under the 2028 Term Loan A Facility and 2028 Term Loan B Facility. As of December 31, 2025, the outstanding balance of the 2028 Term Loan A Facility, the 2028 Term Loan B Facility, and the Revolving Credit Facility was approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_q4HVJlM7Q0StRndL3BeWvQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xbp_TermLoan2028FacilityMember_7xuKX6Q_HUuHn9od-j5myQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LongTermDebt" scale="6" id="Narr_BhBTSlH2tkOhWb0SDIyDOw">2.8</ix:nonFraction> million, $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_q4HVJlM7Q0StRndL3BeWvQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xbp_TermLoan2028BFacilityMember_8cu39lWrI06sRem-rE23fA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LongTermDebt" scale="6" id="Narr_yNmVQ1Qe8EeNiYdgbrU_jw">8.6</ix:nonFraction> million, and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_q4HVJlM7Q0StRndL3BeWvQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_us-gaap_RevolvingCreditFacilityMember_fZKhDYlnuEOv7afgbLjBzg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LongTermDebt" scale="6" id="Narr_5XtAQZfYLUCG9hr1tt4noA">35.6</ix:nonFraction> million, respectively.</p></ix:continuation></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-famil