ecimal" name="us-gaap:DebtorInPossessionFinancingBorrowingsOutstanding" scale="6" id="Narr_bVdo02fXiU-j19dNSufTaQ">193.0</ix:nonFraction> million including accrued interest and interest capitalized monthly on a paid-in-kind basis. Following the Restructuring, the Company issued $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_q4HVJlM7Q0StRndL3BeWvQ" contextRef="As_Of_3_3_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xbp_July2030NotesMaturingJuly152030Member_HkApD3ffU0mOpfpCXqjq1g" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xbp:DebtorReorganizationItemsNotesIssued" scale="6" id="Narr_rismx4L5k0qbURvKCHgI3Q">183.0</ix:nonFraction> million of July 2030 Notes (as described above) in a cashless rollover of a comparable amount of debtor-in-possession obligations with the remaining $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_q4HVJlM7Q0StRndL3BeWvQ" contextRef="As_Of_3_3_2025_b1LbC53IfUi4nPKKpmC6Ww" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xbp:DebtorInPossessionFinancingObligationsCancelled" scale="6" id="Narr_jpA0wL_B7UuZ13CBX3svdA">10.0</ix:nonFraction> million of debtor-in-possession obligations being cancelled and replaced with $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_q4HVJlM7Q0StRndL3BeWvQ" contextRef="As_Of_3_3_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xbp_SuperSeniorTermLoanMaturingJuly282028Member_2-FECXJdX06NOEKv7KqJ-g" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xbp:DebtorReorganizationItemsLoansReplaced" scale="6" id="Narr_xVWt0lET1UmPaUmdblwA1w">6.0</ix:nonFraction> million of loans under the Super Senior Term Loan (as described above).</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Long-Term Debt Outstanding</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-famil