 under common control with HGM, where the Predecessor could provide services under one or more statements of work to DOW. The Predecessor, acting under the first statement of work, provided collection services to DOW to collect past-due medical debts from its patients and insurance companies for which the Predecessor received a commission of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_x-DraIrURkqybk-ATSvGbg" contextRef="As_Of_9_1_2023_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xbp_DoctorsOfWaikikiLlpMember_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_xbp_ForAccountsAssignedWithinOneYearOfServiceMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_srt_AffiliatedEntityMember_4oYGyGNBb0idWuMD4eh2Eg" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xbp:RelatedPartyTransactionsPercentageOfCommissionChargedOnServicesPerformed" scale="-2" id="Narr_t8vwF7OVhESmsYSZ2YpnEA">15</ix:nonFraction>% for accounts assigned within one year of the service date and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_x-DraIrURkqybk-ATSvGbg" contextRef="As_Of_9_1_2023_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xbp_DoctorsOfWaikikiLlpMember_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_xbp_ForAccountsAssignedAfterOneYearOfServiceMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_srt_AffiliatedEntityMember_dQBY_3eWW06kwPn33HUPJw" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xbp:RelatedPartyTransactionsPercentageOfCommissionChargedOnServicesPerformed" scale="-2" id="Narr_m25TXYdHBUaWPSxBPu_vkA">25</ix:nonFraction>% for accounts assigned after one year. Under the second statement of work the Predecessor managed DOW's insurance billing and denial management for medical bills generated after patients receive treatment from DOW for which the Predecessor invoiced $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_q4HVJlM7Q0StRndL3BeWvQ" contextRef="Duration_9_1_2023_To_9_1_2023_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xbp_DoctorsOfWaikikiLlpMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_srt_AffiliatedEntityMember_9SHiwIlse0C8X2DJEA9aIw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xbp:RelatedPartyTransactionsInvoicePerMonth" scale="0" id="Narr_kOPb5pKrREGjzp6Vh8QzWQ">2,000</ix:nonFraction> per month for each full-time employee assigned to the project. For the period January 1, 2025 to July 31, 2025 (Predecessor), the Predecessor recognized $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_q4HVJlM7Q0StRndL3BeWvQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_7_31_2025_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xbp_DoctorsOfWaikikiLlpMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_srt_AffiliatedEntityMember_Zebtq_KE-UuBWDpSoOiGBA" decimals="-6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:Revenues" scale="6" id="Narr_G5dIsTB-oU-XhyTznQn3CA">0</ix:nonFraction> of income under these two SOWs. For the year ended December 31, 2024 (Predecessor), the Predecessor had recognized less than $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_q4HVJlM7Q0StRndL3BeWvQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xbp_DoctorsOfWaikikiLlpMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_srt_AffiliatedEntityMember_mmVPMHNGPEWCcZng9bmMPA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:Revenues" scale="6" id="Narr_Q-e0R8IhYUCbdbYAAGZwTw">0.1</ix:nonFraction> million of income under these two SOWs.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;padding-bottom:12pt;margin:0pt;"><i style="font-style:italic;">April 2026 Notes held by ETI Subsidiaries</i></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:24pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">As of December 31, 2024, $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_q4HVJlM7Q0StRndL3BeWvQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xbp_ExelaTechnologiesIncMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyTransactionAxis_xbp_SeniorSecuredNotesDueApril2026Member_wxyk_QjnOUGiqJ3fxCD9ag" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentCarryingAmount" scale="6" id="Narr_srh23qBNSUim1OLruVXMEg">368.8</ix:nonFraction> million of aggregate principal amount of the Predecessor&#8217;s April 2026 Notes were held by subsidiaries of ETI that had been formed to acquire and hold such indebtedness. The Predecessor recorded net interest expense of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_q4HVJlM7Q0StRndL3BeWvQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_7_31_2025_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xbp_ExelaTechnologiesIncMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyTransactionAxis_xbp_SeniorSecuredNotesDueApril2026Member_qcqiMXo0S02BKGgghbVfLg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:InterestExpenseDebt" scale="6" id="Narr_NRFU37lFlkmscA22w-9rcQ">13.7</ix:nonFraction> million using effective interest rate method on the April 2026 Notes held by such ETI subsidiaries for the period January 1, 2025 to July 31, 2025 (Predecessor). The Predecessor recorded net interest expense of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_q4HVJlM7Q0StRndL3BeWvQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xbp_ExelaTechnologiesIncMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyTransactionAxis_xbp_SeniorSecuredNotesDueApril2026Member_8AReA3giYEWGlBRMSK0n0g" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:InterestExpenseDebt" scale="6" id="Narr_l0NgBqqcKkiO6RTuiq8ZEA">16.7</ix:nonFraction> million using the effective interest rate method on the Predecessor&#8217;s April 2026 Notes held by such ETI subsidiaries for the year ended December 31, 2024 (Predecessor).</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><i style="font-style:italic;">Recharges by ETI</i></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:24pt;margin:8pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Pursuant to carve out of the Predecessor as a separate entity, cost incurred by the Predecessor&#8217;s former parent ETI to support<span style="font-size:12pt;"> </span>the Predecessor business has been recharged by ETI. During the period January 1, 2025 to July 31, 2025 (Predecessor), the Predecessor reimbursed $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_q4HVJlM7Q0StRndL3BeWvQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_7_31_2025_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xbp_ExelaTechnologiesIncMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyTransactionAxis_xbp_RechargesReimbursementMember_8OcFKLRPIUOaFfn9YJG7SA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:OperatingCostsAndExpenses" scale="6" id="Narr_975jkaKVDkS8Krb-BSi9lA">1.2</ix:nonFraction> million to ETI primarily on account of salaries, legal and professional fees and other miscellaneous expenses. During the year ended December 31, 2024 (Predecessor), the Predecessor reimbursed $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_q4HVJlM7Q0StRndL3BeWvQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xbp_ExelaTechnologiesIncMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyTransactionAxis_xbp_RechargesReimbursementMember_xMWq0wBe3kC8rCGNQbcy4w" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:OperatingCostsAndExpenses" scale="6" id="Narr_rkCtE577SkS_XR-jsg3Wkw">8.2</ix:nonFraction> million to ETI primarily on account of salaries, legal and professional fees and other miscellaneous expenses. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><i style="font-style:italic;">Transactions between the Predecessor and XBP Europe Holdings, Inc.</i></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:24pt;margin:8pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">XBP Europe Holdings, Inc. (together with its subsidiaries, &#8220;XBP Europe&#8221;) was a subsidiary of ETI and an affiliate of the Predecessor until the Business Combination. Historically, XBP Europe and its predecessor entities and subsidiaries were managed and operated in the ordinary course of business with other subsidiaries of ETI including the Predecessor. Given below are the transactions that occurred between the Predecessor and XBP Europe during the year ended December 31, 2024 (Predecessor) and for the period January 1, 2025 to July 31, 2025 (Predecessor).</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:24pt;margin:8pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Purchase of Products and Services: during the historical periods presented, the Predecessor purchased products and services from XBP Europe. Related party expense in the consolidated and combined statements of operations include purchases from XBP Europe of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_q4HVJlM7Q0StRndL3BeWvQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_7_31_2025_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xbp_XbpEuropeHoldingsIncMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyTransactionAxis_xbp_PurchaseOfProductsAndServicesMember_c7FT-dMSLkyq8fOQOjlZ2w" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CostOfRevenue" scale="6" id="Narr_YknEtwy84kKQfa08FNyQ7w">0.4</ix:nonFraction> million for the period January 1, 2025 to July 31, 2025 (Predecessor). Related party expense&#160;in the consolidated and combined statements of operations include purchases from XBP Europe of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_q4HVJlM7Q0StRndL3BeWvQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xbp_XbpEuropeHoldingsIncMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyTransactionAxis_xbp_PurchaseOfProductsAndServicesMember_kj2TxrgUeUGAhhdLshklog" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CostOfRevenue" scale="6" id="Narr_wXhs1q-H5ESF-H6DDkenOQ">0.4</ix:nonFraction> million for the year ended December 31, 2024 (Predecessor).</p></ix:continuation></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">138</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:79.3%;border:0;margin:30pt 10.35% 30pt 10.35%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:10.35%;padding-right:10.35%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:21.6pt;min-height:41.75pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 30pt 0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><ix:continuation id="Tb_O7hn1sl6JU-tzVhPHuU-xg_cont3" continuedAt="Tb_O7hn1sl6JU-tzVhPHuU-xg_cont4"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:24pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Sales: during the historical periods presented, the Predecessor sold SDS scanners and related spare parts to XBP Europe. These sales totaled $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_q4HVJlM7Q0StRndL3BeWvQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_7_31_2025_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xbp_XbpEuropeHoldingsIncMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyTransactionAxis_us-gaap_SalesMember_Ge22fIFd40CwUE9EVEzVCA" decimals="-6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:RevenueFromContractWithCustomerExcludingAssessedTax" scale="6" id="Narr_PW2-d9EtrUy_mV1-SE-Jkg">0</ix:nonFraction> for the period January 1, 2025 to July 31, 2025 (Predecessor). These sales totaled $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_q4HVJlM7Q0StRndL3BeWvQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xbp_XbpEuropeHoldingsIncMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyTransactionAxis_us-gaap_SalesMember__jpkZD9V6UiwaAxuiFyfNA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:RevenueFromContractWithCustomerExcludingAssessedTax" scale="6" id="Narr_rTwl-0a3bEih8WbWBpusig">0.1</ix:nonFraction> million for the year ended December 31, 2024 (Predecessor). </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:24pt;margin:8pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Shared Service Center Costs: the historical costs and expenses of XBP Europe include costs for certain shared service functions historically provided by the Predecessor, including, but not limited to accounting and finance, IT and business process operations. Where possible, these charges were allocated based on full-time equivalents (FTEs), formal agreements between the Predecessor and XBP Europe, or other allocation methodologies that Management determined to be a reasonable reflection of the utilization of services provided or the benefit received by XBP Europe and the costs of operating XBP Europe during the periods presented.&#160;The allocated shared service expenses and general corporate expenses for the period January 1, 2025 to July 31, 2025 (Predecessor) were $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_q4HVJlM7Q0StRndL3BeWvQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_7_31_2025_xnXuqSSqxUiqABHyRV_JRw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:OperatingCostsAndExpenses" scale="6" id="Narr_PGCcO1EoAES9VBIXRaX0mA">1.4</ix:nonFraction> million. The allocated shared service expenses and general corporate expenses for the year ended December 31, 2024 (Predecessor) were $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_q4HVJlM7Q0StRndL3BeWvQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xbp_XbpEuropeHoldingsIncMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyTransactionAxis_xbp_SharedServicesMember_CvkuAgh6dUWlpsrQStSsZQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:OperatingCostsAndExpenses" scale="6" id="Narr_4hotThyyEk68CT-JSDHu-A">3.8</ix:nonFraction> million, respectively, and are included in the related party revenue, net in the consolidated and combined statements of operations. In the opinion of management of the Predecessor and XBP Europe, the expense and cost allocations had been determined on a basis considered to be a reasonable reflection of the utilization of services provided or the benefit received by XBP Europe during 2025 and 2024. The amounts that would have been, or will be incurred, on a stand-alone basis could differ from the amounts allocated due to economies of scale, difference in management judgment, a requirement for more or fewer employees or other factors. Management does not believe, however, that it is practicable to estimate what these expenses would have been incurred had XBP Europe operated as an independent entity, including any expenses associated with obtaining any of these services from the Predecessor. In addition, the future results of operations, financial position and cash flows could differ materially from the historical results presented herein.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:24pt;margin:8pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Service Fee: during the historical periods presented, the Predecessor provided management services to XBP Europe in exchange for a management fee. These management services included provision of legal, human resources, corporate finance, and marketing support. The management fee was calculated based on a weighted average of total external revenue, headcount and total assets attributable to XBP Europe. On October 9, 2022, the management fee was terminated and was replaced by the related party service fee pursuant to a certain services agreement, which reduced the fee and modified the services provided. Services provided under the services agreement include sales of certain hardware, operations delivery, finance, accounting, human resource and technology support services. The Predecessor earned total fees of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_q4HVJlM7Q0StRndL3BeWvQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_7_31_2025_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xbp_XbpEuropeHoldingsIncMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyTransactionAxis_xbp_ServiceFeeMember_O4uv_ACi302XftRZjIap2A" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:RevenueFromContractWithCustomerExcludingAssessedTax" scale="6" id="Narr_lg7pC4B7Sk6SKu1a9UJ2-Q">0.8</ix:nonFraction> million for the period January 1, 2025 to July 31, 2025 (Predecessor). The Predecessor earned total fees of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_q4HVJlM7Q0StRndL3BeWvQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xbp_XbpEuropeHoldingsIncMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyTransactionAxis_xbp_ServiceFeeMember_jYym53_j1USsGGFRLkPtEw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:RevenueFromContractWithCustomerExcludingAssessedTax" scale="6" id="Narr_YMzNN0_NTUOO-VpNV9SHAw">1.5</ix:nonFraction> million for the year ended December 31, 2024 (Predecessor).</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:24pt;margin:8pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Notes Receivable:&#160;The combined and consolidated statements of operations included related party interest income of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_q4HVJlM7Q0StRndL3BeWvQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xbp_XbpEuropeHoldingsIncMember_us-gaap_IncomeStatementLocationAxis_us-gaap_OtherNonoperatingIncomeExpenseMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyTransactionAxis_xbp_RelatedPartyNotesReceivableMember_2RlN_9U1u06jsM3-obcedQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:InvestmentIncomeInterest" scale="6" id="Narr_ZQ-81PMyIES1FLzP4EhRwg">0.9</ix:nonFraction> million for the year ended December 31, 2024 (Predecessor) in other income, net relating to certain old terminated intercompany loan agreements with XBP Europe. The Predecessor entered into <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_agreement_rS-tpJ3UQEWJA8AeesJSiA" contextRef="Duration_7_31_2025_To_7_31_2025_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xbp_XbpEuropeHoldingsIncMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyTransactionAxis_xbp_RelatedPartyNotesReceivableMember_OMh54vNOnUS1wY3l366lgw" decimals="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="xbp:NumberOfIntercompanyLoanAgreementsEntered" scale="0" id="Narr_W9FpCq7iVkWLRlHl44A-1w">four</ix:nonFraction> intercompany loan agreements (&#8220;Related Party Notes Receivable&#8221;) with XBP Europe. <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_agreement_rS-tpJ3UQEWJA8AeesJSiA" contextRef="Duration_9_4_2023_To_9_4_2023_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xbp_XbpEuropeHoldingsIncMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyTransactionAxis_xbp_RelatedPartyNotesReceivableMember_ZCRlsGJT4EuYdgz14taC8Q" decimals="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="xbp:NumberOfIntercompanyLoanAgreementsEntered" scale="0" id="Narr_A-A6J5pJpE6HvwmfBo2kww">Three</ix:nonFraction> of the notes are dated September 4, 2023 (and subsequently amended on September 15, 2023) and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_agreement_rS-tpJ3UQEWJA8AeesJSiA" contextRef="Duration_9_15_2023_To_9_15_2023_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xbp_XbpEuropeHoldingsIncMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyTransactionAxis_xbp_RelatedPartyNotesReceivableMember_Wj7cAF6yyUWaqGSS3KyZag" decimals="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="xbp:NumberOfIntercompanyLoanAgreementsEntered" scale="0" id="Narr_M4OiqfzmM0aXAsC4-gR2SA">one</ix:nonFraction> note is dated September 15, 2023. The Related Party Notes Receivable has a <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xbp_XbpEuropeHoldingsIncMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyTransactionAxis_xbp_RelatedPartyNotesReceivableMember_NAzI0qDVlEyDII8rb-ImxQ" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="xbp:ReceivableTerm" id="Narr_rwP-wUpTLEKzgkqr25BihQ">ten-year</ix:nonNumeric> term and bear annual interest of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_x-DraIrURkqybk-ATSvGbg" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xbp_XbpEuropeHoldingsIncMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyTransactionAxis_xbp_RelatedPartyNotesReceivableMember_NAzI0qDVlEyDII8rb-ImxQ" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xbp:ReceivablesInterestRate" scale="-2" id="Narr_ML9JOmLE9UOLtj_twBu5Eg">6.0</ix:nonFraction>%, due at the end of the term. The consolidated and combined balance sheet included $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_q4HVJlM7Q0StRndL3BeWvQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xbp_XbpEuropeHoldingsIncMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyTransactionAxis_xbp_RelatedPartyNotesReceivableMember_TXmsTAcAOk6baNIyye6oQQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:OtherReceivablesNetCurrent" scale="6" id="Narr_TnS1JC6DVUi4aHfX-cbGaw">1.5</ix:nonFraction> million Related Party Notes Receivable as of December 31, 2024 (Predecessor).&#160;The consolidated and combined statements of operations included $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_q4HVJlM7Q0StRndL3BeWvQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_7_31_2025_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xbp_XbpEuropeHoldingsIncMember_us-gaap_IncomeStatementLocationAxis_xbp_InterestIncomeExpenseNonoperatingMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyTransactionAxis_xbp_RelatedPartyNotesReceivableMember_Txh0yFhgZk23BDXKD4_Nkw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:InvestmentIncomeInterest" scale="6" id="Narr_1a60v5rUKk-3DnS8W8Ufgw">0.1</ix:nonFraction> million of related party interest income for the period January 1, 2025 to July 31, 2025 (Predecessor) in the interest expense, net. The consolidated and combined statements of operations included $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_q4HVJlM7Q0StRndL3BeWvQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xbp_XbpEuropeHoldingsIncMember_us-gaap_IncomeStatementLocationAxis_xbp_InterestIncomeExpenseNonoperatingMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyTransactionAxis_xbp_RelatedPartyNotesReceivableMember_2jsgR1DM4U-RxHhEr3LQZA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:InvestmentIncomeInterest" scale="6" id="Narr_Mkns6RSAGkOpM5pIcXrTQA">0.1</ix:nonFraction> million of related party interest income for the year ended December 31, 2024 (Predecessor) in the interest expense, net.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:24pt;margin:8pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','se