tBEiFk-pB1Si6Qg">no</ix:nonFraction> amount outstanding under the BR Exar AR Facility as of March 30, 2026.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Amended BR Exar AR Facility</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;">On January 21, 2026, certain of the Company&#8217;s subsidiaries entered into an Amended and Restated Receivables Purchase Agreement with BREL (as subsequently amended on February 10, 2026 and March 27, 2026 (the &#8220;Amended BR Exar AR Facility&#8221;)), pursuant to which they agreed to sell certain existing receivables and all of their future receivables to BREL until such time as BREL shall have collected $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_q4HVJlM7Q0StRndL3BeWvQ" contextRef="Duration_1_21_2026_To_1_21_2026_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xbp_BrExarArFacilityMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_3Aqi5XFxX0elIJX_lfSMKg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xbp:MinimumAmountOfCollectionRequiredToSellReceivables" scale="6" id="Narr_rf13hfXRzk2vfIA5Z4E3dA">20.0</ix:nonFraction> million, net of any costs, expenses or other amounts paid to or owing to the buyer under the agreement. The Company received $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_q4HVJlM7Q0StRndL3BeWvQ" contextRef="Duration_1_21_2026_To_1_21_2026_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xbp_BrExarArFacilityMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_3Aqi5XFxX0elIJX_lfSMKg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xbp:ProceedsFromSaleOfReceivables" scale="6" id="Narr_1vGWNQmk2UmK7Q6wWrG4jg">14.5</ix:nonFraction> million in net cash consideration for sale of these receivables. The Company adjusted $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_q4HVJlM7Q0StRndL3BeWvQ" contextRef="As_Of_1_21_2026_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xbp_BrExarArFacilityMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_rQtS7xXm50alZrUHpXroBQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xbp:OtherLongTermDebtAdjustedAgainstRemainingConsiderationReceivables" scale="6" id="Narr_40P_0XO04kuNpaJhthQqiQ">5.0</ix:nonFraction> million of outstanding loans owed to BREL under certain promissory note entered into in December 2025 against the remaining sale consideration to be received for the sale of these receivables. During the period January 1, 2026 through March 30, 2026, BREL collected $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_q4HVJlM7Q0StRndL3BeWvQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_3_31_2026_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xbp_BrExarArFacilityMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_rd7aIPvnyU-TLiTXXvza2g" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:RepaymentsOfDebt" scale="6" id="Narr_I7VWcJcYhE2jKCfSigMq2g">10.1</ix:nonFraction> million </p></ix:nonNumeric></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">141</p></div></div>
