Of_3_31_2026_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xbp_SuperSeniorTermLoanMaturingJuly282028Member_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_FTUYZWTyiECU0b8szXbkOQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LongTermDebt" scale="6" id="Narr_IlG6RTz_fECtLha99C7CmQ">50.0</ix:nonFraction> million outstanding under the Super Senior Term Loan.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Amendment to ABL Facility</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On March 6, 2026, the ABL Borrowers, the Agent and the ABL Lenders entered into a Limited Waiver and Third Amendment to the ABL Facility (the "Amended ABL Facility&#8221;). Among other things, the Amended ABL Facility (i) eliminates the covenant requiring the ABL Borrower to maintain a minimum excess availability of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_q4HVJlM7Q0StRndL3BeWvQ" contextRef="As_Of_3_6_2026_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xbp_AblFacilityMaturingJuly292028Member_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_GnKZO6fclESdVl6V8LfJww" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xbp:DebtInstrumentCovenantMinimumLiquidityRequirement" scale="6" id="Narr_jaVY2HuaeESW4molVw5rZQ">7.5</ix:nonFraction> million; (ii) implements a temporary availability block through June 30, 2026, which reduces borrowing capacity by the greater of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_q4HVJlM7Q0StRndL3BeWvQ" contextRef="As_Of_3_6_2026_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xbp_AblFacilityMaturingJuly292028Member_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_GnKZO6fclESdVl6V8LfJww" decimals="-4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xbp:DebtInstrumentReducedBorrowingCapacity" scale="6" id="Narr_-_73PtU8p0qHYlne-zJXuA">3.75</ix:nonFraction> million or <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_x-DraIrURkqybk-ATSvGbg" contextRef=